    "body": "Merge-time refresh (pushed by the maintainer's session (maintainer edits)): merged main into the branch, head 3c694a93 -> 9c552160.\n- crates/app/src/posting_serves.rs: module doc kept both paragraphs (#1266 serves note + main's per-section turning rule); the code auto-merged (serves() keeps declared_serves, then main's unturned() check; the plain refusal keeps the serves hint).\n- crates/app/tests/post_serves_kind.rs: kept both tests (a_users_own_script_is_judged_by_the_kinds_it_states and main's mill-turn test).\n- PROCESS_VERSION unchanged (no process files touched).\nGate: post_serves_kind and post_serves_plasma green, camcraft-post tests green, clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-post --all-targets -D warnings clean.\nDelta class: DELTA (two hand-resolved files; reviewed sha 3c694a93, clean review by mkinney). Needs a read-only delta review of the remerge-diff.",
