    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 9c5521603fc8f7004bad325f6c4083b8423f192d -->\nDelta review of the merge of main (9c552160) into this branch; the earlier clean review of 3c694a93 stands for everything else. Verdict: Ready for the maintainer to merge.\n\nRead from `git show --remerge-diff`, the two hand-resolved files only:\n- `crates/app/src/posting_serves.rs`: module doc keeps both paragraphs (the `serves = [...]` one and main's per-section turning one). In code, `serves()` runs the registry check, then `declared_serves`, then the undeclared-dialect fallback. `refusal()` keeps main's `unturned()` check after a true `serves()`. Everything main refused is still refused: a post that does not serve the kind is refused first, and a served post still goes through the turning-section check on a lathe or mill-turn. Declaring `serves` cannot skip it.\n- `crates/app/tests/post_serves_kind.rs`: both sides' tests kept, and the trailing `written(&dir)` cleanup is intact in each. Nothing from main was dropped.\n\nNot rebuilt: the logic order is plain from the diff, so I ran no tests for this delta.\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
